{"title":"Career roadmap · Ground Staff","role":"Ground Staff","summary":"Career alignment: Ground Staff are airport professionals who support the passenger and aircraft turnaround process on the ground. Depending on the employer and function, the work can include check-in, boarding, baggage coordination, passenger assistance, gate operations, ramp coordination, arrivals, customer service and airport operations support.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For this career, the degree provides the management foundation, but airport exposure, operational discipline, safety awareness, communication and practical training are especially important."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Typical Role","Primary Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"Ground Staff / Airport Customer Service Executive"},{"text":"Passenger and airport operations"}],[{"text":"1–3 years"},{"text":"Senior Ground Staff / Airport Operations Executive"},{"text":"Operational coordination"}],[{"text":"2–5 years"},{"text":"Airport Operations Supervisor"},{"text":"Team and shift supervision"}],[{"text":"4–7 years"},{"text":"Airport Duty Manager / Station Executive"},{"text":"Airport/station operations"}],[{"text":"6–10 years"},{"text":"Airport Operations Manager"},{"text":"Operational leadership"}],[{"text":"10+ years"},{"text":"Airport/Station Head"},{"text":"Airport business and operations"}],[{"text":"Long-term"},{"text":"Airport Operations Director / Aviation Business Head"},{"text":"Strategic leadership"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During the Degree","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Aviation & Airport Foundations"},{"type":"h","text":"Business fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Principles of Management"},{"text":"Accounting"},{"text":"Economics"},{"text":"Business Communication"},{"text":"Business Statistics"},{"text":"Marketing"},{"text":"Human Resource Management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Aviation fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Airline business models"},{"text":"Airport business models"},{"text":"Domestic vs international aviation"},{"text":"Passenger journey"},{"text":"Aircraft turnaround"},{"text":"Airport stakeholders"},{"text":"Airline vs airport responsibilities"},{"text":"Ground handling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Airport ecosystem"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the roles of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Airlines"},{"text":"Airport operators"},{"text":"Ground-handling companies"},{"text":"Security agencies"},{"text":"Immigration"},{"text":"Customs"},{"text":"Air traffic control"},{"text":"Airport retailers"},{"text":"Cargo operators"},{"text":"Maintenance organisations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Passenger journey"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Booking","Airport Arrival","Check-in","Security","Gate","Boarding","Flight","Arrival","Baggage Claim","Exit"]},{"type":"h","text":"Project"},{"type":"h","text":"Airport Operations Mapping Project"},{"type":"p","text":"Map the passenger journey at a major airport and identify:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Touchpoints"},{"text":"Operational teams"},{"text":"Passenger waiting points"},{"text":"Potential delays"},{"text":"Service-quality issues"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Passenger Handling & Ground Operations"},{"type":"h","text":"Passenger services"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the concepts behind:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Check-in"},{"text":"Boarding passes"},{"text":"Gate operations"},{"text":"Boarding"},{"text":"Arrival assistance"},{"text":"Transfer passengers"},{"text":"Special assistance"},{"text":"Unaccompanied minors"},{"text":"Elderly passengers"},{"text":"Passengers with reduced mobility"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Actual procedures and system access depend on the airport, airline and ground handler."},{"type":"h","text":"Baggage operations"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Baggage acceptance"},{"text":"Tagging"},{"text":"Baggage reconciliation"},{"text":"Transfer baggage"},{"text":"Arrival baggage"},{"text":"Mishandled baggage"},{"text":"Lost baggage"},{"text":"Damaged baggage"},{"text":"Baggage claims"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Customer service"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Professional communication"},{"text":"Complaint handling"},{"text":"Conflict resolution"},{"text":"Cross-cultural communication"},{"text":"Service recovery"},{"text":"Stress management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Airline systems"},{"type":"p","text":"Become familiar with concepts around:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Passenger Service Systems"},{"text":"Departure Control Systems"},{"text":"Reservation systems"},{"text":"Baggage systems"},{"text":"Airport operational systems"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Students should learn the concepts; actual production systems are normally taught by employers."},{"type":"h","text":"Project"},{"type":"h","text":"Airport Passenger Service Simulation"},{"type":"p","text":"Design workflows for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Check-in"},{"text":"Boarding"},{"text":"Arrival"},{"text":"Baggage issue"},{"text":"Passenger complaint"},{"text":"Flight disruption"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Airport Operations, Safety & Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"This year should move from passenger service toward airport operations management."},{"type":"h","text":"Aircraft turnaround"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the broad turnaround process:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Arrival","Parking","Passenger disembarkation","Baggage/cargo handling","Cleaning","Catering","Refuelling","Boarding","Departure"]},{"type":"p","text":"Different activities are coordinated by different specialised teams."},{"type":"h","text":"Ground handling"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the functions of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Passenger handling"},{"text":"Baggage handling"},{"text":"Ramp services"},{"text":"Aircraft cleaning"},{"text":"Catering coordination"},{"text":"Cargo handling"},{"text":"Load-related operational coordination"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Safety"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop awareness of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Airside safety"},{"text":"Ramp safety"},{"text":"Personal protective equipment"},{"text":"Foreign Object Debris"},{"text":"Vehicle safety"},{"text":"Aircraft proximity risks"},{"text":"Emergency procedures"},{"text":"Safety reporting"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Safety-critical procedures must always follow the employer, airport, airline and applicable aviation authority's current procedures and training."},{"type":"h","text":"Airport security awareness"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Passenger screening"},{"text":"Restricted areas"},{"text":"Access control"},{"text":"Identification"},{"text":"Security protocols"},{"text":"Prohibited items"},{"text":"Incident escalation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Basic SQL"},{"text":"Statistics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Airport KPIs"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Passenger throughput"},{"text":"Check-in waiting time"},{"text":"Boarding time"},{"text":"Flight punctuality"},{"text":"Turnaround time"},{"text":"Baggage delivery time"},{"text":"Mishandled baggage rate"},{"text":"Customer satisfaction"},{"text":"Queue time"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project"},{"type":"h","text":"Airport Operations Performance Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Track:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Passenger volume"},{"text":"Flight delays"},{"text":"Turnaround performance"},{"text":"Queue times"},{"text":"Baggage performance"},{"text":"Customer complaints"},{"text":"Service quality"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Airport Management, Disrupt