:"AI should support operational teams; safety-critical aviation decisions remain subject to qualified personnel and approved procedures."},{"type":"h","text":"Final-Year Project"},{"type":"h","text":"AI-Powered Airport Ground Operations & Passenger Experience Platform"},{"type":"h","text":"Modules"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Passenger-flow dashboard"},{"text":"Check-in analytics"},{"text":"Boarding analytics"},{"text":"Baggage tracking simulation"},{"text":"Queue monitoring"},{"text":"Staff allocation"},{"text":"Flight-disruption dashboard"},{"text":"Customer complaint system"},{"text":"AI passenger-support assistant"},{"text":"Operations KPI dashboard"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Suggested technology"},{"type":"note","label":"Frontend","text":"React / HTML/CSS/JS\nBackend: Python/FastAPI\nDatabase: PostgreSQL/MySQL\nAnalytics: Excel + Power BI\nAI: LLM/API\nCloud: AWS/Azure fundamentals\nVersion Control: Git/GitHub"},{"type":"h","text":"4-Year Honours / Advanced Variant"},{"type":"h","text":"Airport Operations Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Passenger operations"},{"text":"Ground handling"},{"text":"Resource management"},{"text":"Airport coordination"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Airline Operations"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Flight operations"},{"text":"Passenger services"},{"text":"Turnaround"},{"text":"Airline station management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Aviation Safety"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Safety management"},{"text":"Risk"},{"text":"Incident reporting"},{"text":"Airside safety"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Aviation Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Passenger analytics"},{"text":"Operational forecasting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Aviation Technology"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Airport systems"},{"text":"Biometr